# Prettier's endOfLine default is "lf" and CI runs on Linux. Git for Windows
# ships core.autocrlf=true in its system config, so without this a fresh Windows
# clone gets CRLF working files and `npm run format:check` flags every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
